stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> STOPPED

    STOPPED --> STARTING: Runtime starts Launcher
    STARTING --> CONNECTING: process initialized
    CONNECTING --> PREPARING: Runtime IPC established
    CONNECTING --> DEGRADED_DISCONNECTED: IPC unavailable

    PREPARING --> READY_PRECOMMIT: initial UX + focus ready
    READY_PRECOMMIT --> ACTIVE: Runtime reports committed GAME
    READY_PRECOMMIT --> STOPPING: GAME transition cancelled/failed

    ACTIVE --> BACKGROUND_GAME_RUNNING: GAME_RUNNING_CONFIRMED
    BACKGROUND_GAME_RUNNING --> RESTORING: GAME_EXITED_CONFIRMED
    RESTORING --> ACTIVE: foreground + route restored

    ACTIVE --> DEGRADED_DISCONNECTED: Runtime IPC lost
    BACKGROUND_GAME_RUNNING --> DEGRADED_DISCONNECTED: Runtime IPC lost
    DEGRADED_DISCONNECTED --> ACTIVE: reconnect snapshot says GAME/no running game
    DEGRADED_DISCONNECTED --> BACKGROUND_GAME_RUNNING: reconnect snapshot says GAME_RUNNING
    DEGRADED_DISCONNECTED --> STOPPING: reconnect says Launcher no longer valid

    ACTIVE --> STOPPING: GAME leaving / Runtime shutdown
    RESTORING --> STOPPING: GAME leaving
    STOPPING --> STOPPED
    STOPPED --> [*]

    note right of READY_PRECOMMIT
        Launcher ready != GAME committed
    end note

    note right of BACKGROUND_GAME_RUNNING
        Game owns ordinary input/foreground
        Launcher remains resident by default
    end note